{"3952820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desserted", "steam_appid": 3952820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> “<strong>Desserted</strong>”</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>1-6 player co-op survival horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/45278df9c3b27ca641ec9d2d008acc6e.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated maps in your mobile food truck. Gather, cook, and defend your power grid from monsters seeking to sabotage you. Survive deadly blackouts and complete sacrifices to progress to more difficult and exciting maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE CORE LOOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge → Collect → Sizzle → Blackout → Escape → Sacrifice → Repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/217875b735fcb5ce89cf1a297174167f.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=174 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c0c978c7a059f132b5e52ddf8d4898a3.poster.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1000 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c0c978c7a059f132b5e52ddf8d4898a3.webm?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/c0c978c7a059f132b5e52ddf8d4898a3.mp4?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters — Not Just Killers, they troll.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters aren't just hunters; they are saboteurs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Phase:</strong> Monsters focus on <strong>sabotaging electrical infrastructure</strong> (breakers and cables) rather than direct player combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackout Phase:</strong> Once power hits zero, monsters enter a &quot;Starvation&quot; state and <strong>actively hunt players</strong>. Survival difficulty scales exponentially.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/b6c0cea4c4956a9bb8efd7bb14c37a57.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/d568e598175436c9289e4b8793118949.poster.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/d568e598175436c9289e4b8793118949.webm?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/d568e598175436c9289e4b8793118949.mp4?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power &amp; &quot;Sacrifice&quot; System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends entirely on <strong>Time Management</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed Time Limit:</strong> Each session has a set power duration. When it runs out, the map enters a high-difficulty <strong>&quot;Blackout Mode.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Sabotage:</strong> During the day, monsters prioritize <strong>locating and destroying circuit breakers</strong>. Damaged breakers significantly accelerate power drain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Priority:</strong> Players must patrol and protect breakers to <strong>delay the onset of night</strong> and maximize exploration time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackout Phase:</strong> When the lights go out, the environment shifts. Monsters enter an active hunting state, but <strong>high-reward resources</strong> only become accessible during this time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/490e620959ad4e713a499b674100e602.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/e9f41bd7e1379fa57c9d0df132cb94d9.poster.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/e9f41bd7e1379fa57c9d0df132cb94d9.webm?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/e9f41bd7e1379fa57c9d0df132cb94d9.mp4?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food truck is the heart of the team.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truck is your primary tool for survival and resource processing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredient Scanner:</strong> Use the short-range scanner to <strong>highlight hidden ingredients</strong>, significantly increasing gathering efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking System:</strong> Process raw ingredients into dishes to fulfill <strong>mission objectives</strong> or gain vital <strong>survival buffs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/503cad0e92bc98722fcba0ed3c11ad26.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.poster.avif?t=1778791536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.webm?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.mp4?t=1778791536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UP TO 6-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your team to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> raw materials together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain</strong> the power grid and defend critical infrastructure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade</strong> or fight back during the hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete</strong> objectives and perform <strong>sacrifices to the gods</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extra